  "inset_rule": "RETIRED 2026-09-01. The hub's panels are purpose-baked S_HUB_* sprites that draw EDGE TO EDGE (measured: zero transparent padding), so rect == node box. The old adj[] carried the drawn-body inset of Next Hole Panel.png, whose shadow lived inside its 9-slice border; keeping it after the re-skin made every panel draw 31px too big and ate the frame's 20px gaps."
